{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaeguahe/panel_constellation

    The towns as a constellation, in the skin «cinemático» (C): in Cifras («De dónde vienen») and in Previsión («Hasta
    dónde llega el centro»). Each town is a light in its direction from the centre, at its distance on a square-root scale (the
    near ones get room); the server writes its place twice, for the wide box (16:6: x, y) and for the phone (8:9: xm, ym),
    each with one scale for both axes. Its size by the count (t, from 0 to 1, the square root of the share of the
    largest); with rings (Previsión), the ring is the children of those ages and the core, the share that are the
    centre's (core). When the centre is in a town (that town, or within 2 km of its point), there is no «centre»: that
    star has iscentre and centrename, and takes the halo of the centre. escena.js places the names where they fit. Towns without a position (no code, another country) go on a quiet row at the foot. No contours, no
    geography: nothing says where anybody lives. A drawing only: the bars or the table under it are its twin.
    Design: Jujol, 9 November 2026; the sky, Gaudí.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "rings": true, "foot": "El anillo son los niños de esas edades; la luz de dentro, los del centro.",
        "centre": {"x": 0.33, "y": 0.5, "xm": 0.5, "ym": 0.3, "name": "El centro"},
        "stars": [{"x": 0.507, "y": 0.479, "xm": 0.772, "ym": 0.457, "t": 1, "core": 0.012, "hascore": true,
            "left": false, "leftm": true, "iscentre": false, "centrename": "", "name": "Getafe", "n": "17"}],
        "unplaced": [{"k": 0, "t": 0.3, "name": "Otro país", "n": "2"}]
    }
}}
<div class="cine-constelacion{{#rings}} con-anillos{{/rings}}" aria-hidden="true">
    <ol>
        {{#centre}}<li class="estrella-centro" style="--x: {{x}}; --y: {{y}}; --xm: {{xm}}; --ym: {{ym}}"><span class="estrella-luz"></span><span class="estrella-nombre">{{name}}</span></li>{{/centre}}
        {{#stars}}<li class="estrella{{#left}} izq{{/left}}{{#leftm}} izq-m{{/leftm}}{{#iscentre}} es-centro{{/iscentre}}" style="--x: {{x}}; --y: {{y}}; --xm: {{xm}}; --ym: {{ym}}; --t: {{t}}{{#hascore}}; --nucleo: {{core}}{{/hascore}}"><span class="estrella-luz"></span><span class="estrella-nombre" dir="auto">{{name}} <b>{{n}}</b>{{#iscentre}}<small class="estrella-aqui">{{centrename}}</small>{{/iscentre}}</span></li>{{/stars}}
        {{#unplaced}}<li class="estrella sin-sitio" style="--k: {{k}}; --t: {{t}}"><span class="estrella-luz"></span><span class="estrella-nombre" dir="auto">{{name}} <b>{{n}}</b></span></li>{{/unplaced}}
    </ol>
    <p class="cine-constelacion-pie">{{foot}}</p>
</div>
